# Keys allowed to sign release tags (vX.Y.Z), in ssh-keygen(1) "ALLOWED SIGNERS" format.
#
# Only FIDO2 security keys (sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com) are accepted, and the release
# workflow also requires that the tag was signed with touch + PIN. A signature can't
# prove which device made it, so a key is added only after the PR reviewer has checked
# it lives on the maintainer's YubiKey. See RELEASING.md.
#
# The release workflow reads this file from main, so adding a key needs a reviewed PR.
# While the list below is empty, every release fails at the verify-tag step.
# This file is public: use the GitHub handle as the name, not an email address.
#
# <github-handle> namespaces="git" sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com AAAA...
